 "kind": "refuse",
 "message": "I can't file a payroll access request for you. Payroll is a restricted system, and under POL-ACC-02 it is only open to full-time Finance and HR staff. Your record shows you are a full-time Dispatch Coordinator in Operations, so you aren't eligible. The helpdesk can't make exceptions. The only route under the policy is for your department head to email Security directly to request an exception.\n\nFor the overtime hours themselves, I don't have a policy that covers how overtime corrections are made, so I haven't answered that. If you'd like, I can escalate it to HR so someone can tell you the right route. Your manager, Kofi Mensah, may also be able to help.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-ACC-02"
 ]
}
